<title>JAPAN: Biwako Bank shares recover ground.</title>
<headline>Biwako Bank shares recover ground.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Biwako Bank Ltd bounced back in Thursday morning trade, after falling on Wednesday morning and being suspended for the afternoon session.</p>
<p>The share price of the regional bank, based in western Japan, was up 19 yen at 510 yen at 0103 GMT, on volume of 50,000 shares.</p>
<p>The bank said on Wednesday that it believed a former employee had improperly used bank funds worth about 3.4 billion yen, of which about 400 million yen would be recoverable.</p>
